        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86349, Sandcast Bronze Rail Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze Rail Door Pull is a great choice for your industrial chic project. It will fit 1-3/4 inch thick wood, fiberglass, or metal doors and comes with the thru-bolt hardware to mount it. The Rail Sandcast Bronze Pull has a rustic look that is reminiscent of turn of the century hardware. Choose from either 12 inch or 18 inch sizes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-rail-pull-set-pair-emtek-btb-86349\"><b>Rail Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Rail Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86349-specififcations.pdf?v=1704262360\"><b>Emtek Rail Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86349:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 13/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86350:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 13/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
